  {
   "short": "Adjusted EPS exceeds guidance",
   "name_fr": "Adjusted EPS exceeds guidance",
   "story_fr": "Le b\u00e9n\u00e9fice ajust\u00e9 pr\u00e9liminaire de 2,86 $ d\u00e9passe le plafond de la fourchette de pr\u00e9visions pr\u00e9c\u00e9dentes de 2,75 $ \u00e0 2,85 $.",
